Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.75,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Pick out some bread and drinks for breakfast tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:07.48,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:09.78,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do it without running!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.71,0:00:16.93,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,He doesn't listen to a thing I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.89,0:00:21.16,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see. For a cold, we need water,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:23.63,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,sports drinks, dairy products,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.61,0:00:27.07,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and some food that's easy to digest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.39,0:00:30.05,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Want to get something for breakfast, Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.05,0:00:31.40,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Like cereal or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:32.25,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.03,0:00:34.22,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.93,0:00:41.77,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did I give it to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:45.09,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:50.30,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The cold virus is everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:53.49,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes you catch it, and sometimes you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:58.12,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to worry about where she caught it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.09,0:01:02.68,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I pick out something to give her too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:03.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:10.13,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.02,0:01:15.18,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Put it in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:21.80,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:24.98,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And what exactly are you doing in the snacks corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.76,0:01:28.99,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki! About breakfast{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.21,0:01:33.37,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It came off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:16.30,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,My place is this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:24.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I think we should leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.06,0:03:25.95,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to bother her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.95,0:03:26.58,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:29.66,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's food in here. Give it to your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:30.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.55,0:03:32.83,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa, that's heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.83,0:03:34.15,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:39.98,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Mom! Daikichi gave us stuff to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:42.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you hear what I just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.87,0:03:44.35,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.26,0:03:49.60,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:54.82,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for causing you so much trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.82,0:03:58.37,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, we owe you for when you took care of Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.37,0:04:00.29,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,How's Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.29,0:04:02.69,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's completely fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.69,0:04:04.54,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She went to school today too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:06.04,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.11,0:04:10.03,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening. Glad you're all right, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.40,0:04:13.83,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I'm making that porridge right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.19,0:04:16.86,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be feeling better in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:22.01,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, let's go throw my tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.34,0:04:23.82,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.07,0:04:29.85,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.85,0:04:30.80,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.91,0:04:36.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nitani-san, you might have gotten your cold from Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.06,0:04:37.34,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:39.92,Usaghi Main Top,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll throw it from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.81,0:04:41.58,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I meet a lot of people every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:41.58,Usaghi Main Top,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.81,0:04:44.30,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I take a crowded train to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.81,0:04:47.27,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,There's no telling where I got it from,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.68,0:04:49.45,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,so don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.76,0:04:51.52,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,It's just a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:54.75,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.99,0:04:58.90,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The least I could do is help out with Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:00.95,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I could pick him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:04.17,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.02,0:05:08.12,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.71,0:05:16.08,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, let's play video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.08,0:05:17.80,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.61,0:05:22.26,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, make sure you help your mom out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.02,0:05:24.85,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.03,0:05:32.69,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.45,0:05:36.62,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The pudding and small drink are from Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.64,0:05:40.89,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.87,0:05:43.74,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Pudding is my favorite!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.59,0:05:46.08,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:06:00.12,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:03.97,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's still early, and it's Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.97,0:06:07.61,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I told you I have practice for the jump rope competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:15.07,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:19.15,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This one is wobbling too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.79,0:06:21.35,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Brush softly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.35,0:06:22.01,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:24.82,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.97,0:06:31.03,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:38.34,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is it okay for you to be up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.63,0:06:41.07,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:44.05,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for taking advantage of your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.33,0:06:48.67,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Me too. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:49.63,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.63,0:06:51.66,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a little surprised at Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.66,0:06:54.02,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,He can't seem to do it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.51,0:06:59.36,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, you're jumping too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.12,0:07:05.99,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The rope comes around like this, and you have to jump here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.99,0:07:06.55,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.95,0:07:09.70,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So you shouldn't move your arms and legs at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:10.86,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:12.73,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,First your arms, then your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.73,0:07:14.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Try doing it slowly first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:15.62,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:18.13,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Me too, me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:19.37,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.37,0:07:21.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, you swing your arms too wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:23.74,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Keep your arms close, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:25.76,Usaghi Main,guy1,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.05,0:07:28.45,Usaghi Main,guy1,0000,0000,0000,,You're pretty early!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:30.98,Usaghi Main,guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:32.51,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They're sure in high spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:39.77,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nobu-kun is pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.77,0:07:41.16,Usaghi Main,guy2,0000,0000,0000,,It's because of his big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:42.77,Usaghi Main,guy2,0000,0000,0000,,He copies him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:48.49,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-chan, aren't you going to join them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:53.86,Usaghi Main,guy1,0000,0000,0000,,One of her upper teeth came off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:59.91,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Girls have it rough even when they're small.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:02.66,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.12,0:08:05.87,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of container do you have for your teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:07.38,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have a cute one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:09.79,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.79,0:08:12.48,Usaghi Main,guy1,0000,0000,0000,,A case to store the baby teeth as a keepsake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:12.97,Usaghi Main,guy1,0000,0000,0000,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:13.59,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Keepsake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:16.91,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,They have these small and cute ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:15.26,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Small?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.75,0:08:16.91,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.91,0:08:17.56,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:18.37,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.37,0:08:20.48,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Mine's a butterfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.47,0:08:23.96,Usaghi Main Top,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I bought one for my kid too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:24.19,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds like something Rin would love!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.61,0:08:28.01,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Dammit! To think there'd be things like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:32.66,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's always been like this since I met Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:36.14,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I get all flustered and scared over the smallest things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:40.35,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you can have this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:41.79,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I drew it at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:41.79,Copy of Insert,SIGNS (above draawing),0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx93.75\fscy77.5\pos(302,266)}Kaga Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:41.79,Copy of Insert,SIGNS (below drawing),0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(313,335)\fscx101.25\fscy76.25}Daikichi
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:41.79,Copy of Insert,SIGNS (text),0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx63.75\fscy75\pos(391,254)}The meat and potatoes that \NDaikichi make are very tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:41.79,Copy of Insert,SIGNS (text),0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx70\fscy77.5\pos(391,346)}Also, Daikichi can \Nrun fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:44.84,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We were supposed to introduce someone from our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.26,0:08:48.46,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.15,0:08:52.34,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:53.63,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:55.86,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,You put your baby teeth in there
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:57.08,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,as a keepsake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.08,0:08:58.10,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Keepsake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:01.26,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Kouki-kun's mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.26,0:09:02.81,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.29,0:09:04.85,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:06.60,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But isn't that Kouki's?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:08.03,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.03,0:09:10.03,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll throw mine with all my strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.03,0:09:10.78,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,As you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:13.93,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I already threw the other ones up until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:14.83,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:18.99,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure it is. You can keep some and throw some. It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.99,0:09:20.17,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.19,0:09:34.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'll jump rope with you next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:41.44,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There you go, touching it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:43.89,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Just leave it be. It'll came off soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:48.19,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She'll definitely look like she got punched.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.90,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She should at least keep herself from smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.62,0:09:52.86,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:09:55.86,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:00.99,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you grow taller again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.15,0:10:05.21,Usaghi Main,guy1,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Daikichi-san too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:07.99,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gaining a bit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.99,0:10:09.29,Usaghi Main,guy1,0000,0000,0000,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.29,0:10:11.64,Usaghi Main,guy1,0000,0000,0000,,It's tough once you reach this age.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.64,0:10:13.63,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I want to hold it back, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:20.37,Usaghi Main,guy1,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san is doing it like a boxer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:21.77,Usaghi Main,guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:24.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's easier on the knees this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:30.10,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, show me how to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.11,0:10:31.48,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:34.19,Usaghi Main Top,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.93,0:10:34.83,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What, you want to be the only cool one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:37.98,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You need to be able to jump properly first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.98,0:10:39.09,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.38,0:10:42.89,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.89,0:10:44.41,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:56.35,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, you're so good at skipping backwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.89,0:10:57.34,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kids are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.81,0:11:01.06,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Kids are full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:02.93,Usaghi Main Top,kids,0000,0000,0000,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:04.52,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why do they have so much stamina?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.05,0:11:14.11,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, adults are amazing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.65,0:11:15.58,Usaghi Main,guy1,0000,0000,0000,,Adults?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:18.82,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure you guys know about it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:25.00,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not Rin's dad. We just started living together a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:29.50,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Until then, I just spent all my time for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:33.62,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,After I started living with Rin, my lifestyle suddenly changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.53,0:11:37.68,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But you guys have been with kids for a long time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.97,0:11:43.80,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's still early for me, so I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:50.48,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just wondering if I can live without any time for myself in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:55.38,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think that way at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:56.84,Usaghi Main,guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:11:57.63,Usaghi Main,guy1,0000,0000,0000,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:00.32,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.32,0:12:02.32,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.83,0:12:07.86,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.99,0:12:14.09,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, didn't you have the jump rope competition today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.09,0:12:15.30,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:16.00,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:19.01,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.99,0:12:22.22,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How many jumps?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.74,0:12:25.18,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,15.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.18,0:12:26.37,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.23,0:12:30.69,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What about backwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.86,0:12:35.40,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,203 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.73,0:12:38.67,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You jumped that many times?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:40.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you get first place for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.88,0:12:43.91,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. This is the certificate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:47.08,Copy of Copy of Insert,SIGNS (bold),0000,0000,0000,,{\frz17.081\fscx77.5\fscy158.75\pos(279,38)}Certificate of Merit
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:47.08,Copy of Copy of Insert,SIGNS,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz18.305\fscx113.75\fscy106.25\pos(327,147)}First Year
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:47.08,Copy of Copy of Insert,SIGNS (line2),0000,0000,0000,,{\frz19.104\pos(358,260)\fscx98.75\fscy107.5}Backward Skipping Competition 1st Place
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:47.08,Copy of Copy of Insert,SIGNS line3),0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx231.25\fscy93.75\pos(344,343)\frz17.971}Kaga Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:45.98,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You really worked hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.98,0:12:47.08,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.07,0:12:50.55,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I could have done more in the forward jumping, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.55,0:12:53.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You only get one chance, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:59.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, you can jump a lot now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.43,0:13:01.09,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I know that for a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:06.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I lost some weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:09.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:11.02,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:15.76,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Will we be there soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:18.25,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, around 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.43,0:13:21.00,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They want to look at your wobbly front teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.23,0:13:25.34,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, don't keep touching them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:27.64,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want to show them how good I can jump rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:28.41,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.40,0:13:31.72,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You've grown a lot lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.72,0:13:34.60,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure my mom and dad will be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.60,0:13:38.56,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if she'll say that I'll outgrow her soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:41.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's too early for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.49,0:13:48.94,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I need to report this to Grandpa too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.57,0:13:57.06,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:00.44,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, I was waiting to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:01.48,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.48,0:14:04.67,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you've gotten so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.92,0:14:06.98,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,Are you one of the tallest in the class?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:07.67,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:11.13,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,You should've called us. We would've come to pick you up by car.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.13,0:14:14.12,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's just 10 minutes, and Rin wanted to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.78,0:14:17.52,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,You'll outgrow me soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.38,0:14:27.61,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kazumi-onee-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.61,0:14:29.51,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey there. You're here pretty early.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.51,0:14:31.52,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I just got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:33.01,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Those clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.01,0:14:35.49,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You used to wear them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.49,0:14:36.36,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.36,0:14:38.86,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Your mom sent them over the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.42,0:14:42.08,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, let me look at your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.08,0:14:42.85,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.63,0:14:49.71,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The two front teeth are wobbling now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.71,0:14:51.87,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? Doesn't it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:55.60,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes, but I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:14:56.58,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a pro after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:15:00.28,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Can't we do something for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:01.83,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Her gums are getting red!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.83,0:15:03.82,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They're just a little red.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.82,0:15:07.48,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, you wanted to tie strings to mine and pull them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.61,0:15:07.50,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A string?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.48,0:15:10.05,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.02,0:15:13.43,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I made it all as soft as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.43,0:15:14.52,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.69,0:15:20.22,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You want some tofu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.22,0:15:20.90,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.13,0:15:23.33,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have some boiled beans too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:24.35,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:27.35,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Eat as much as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.31,0:15:34.30,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I love tofu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:44.65,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did it come off?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:45.88,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.32,0:15:50.97,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It came off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.87,0:15:54.25,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.25,0:15:55.75,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Mom, the tissues!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:56.81,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.81,0:15:58.24,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:15:59.15,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, use this for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.15,0:16:00.54,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,That's a cleaning cloth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.31,0:16:07.02,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan has changed a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:09.16,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.48,0:16:12.35,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That might be the real Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:16.32,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I hear you're getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:18.29,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Mom told me earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.50,0:16:19.29,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.29,0:16:20.80,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.80,0:16:22.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I heard he's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:24.30,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:29.65,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Only thing is, he wants a kid as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.65,0:16:31.09,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.09,0:16:32.51,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,No, it isn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:34.83,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Drinking, going to concerts,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.83,0:16:36.48,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,taking trips, eating tasty food...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.79,0:16:38.64,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I won't be able to do any of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.48,0:16:42.31,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You should talk about it with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.31,0:16:44.15,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.82,0:16:47.16,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I'm horrible with kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.16,0:16:50.36,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to become a whiny old lady either!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:56.83,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think I can sacrifice myself to take care of a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.58,0:17:01.51,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, it'll all work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.51,0:17:03.04,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If that's what you decide,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.45,0:17:05.70,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,you won't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.70,0:17:08.81,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,You're talking like this doesn't concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:10.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that might be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.87,0:17:12.48,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:20.30,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I've never had to be in the position of a mother, father, or husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.78,0:17:24.90,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.15,0:17:31.53,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,It's true I don't have time to shop leisurely
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.53,0:17:33.37,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,or go out for tea,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.70,0:17:37.33,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,but when I'm working, that time is for me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.76,0:17:46.84,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,The time I spend with my child is my time too,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.84,0:17:48.20,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,and it's very precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.20,0:17:52.84,Usaghi Main,guy1,0000,0000,0000,,Being a parent isn't anything special.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.45,0:17:57.76,Usaghi Main,guy2,0000,0000,0000,,There are moms and dads everywhere you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.63,0:18:04.71,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:07.37,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.54,0:18:32.63,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:38.21,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My adult teeth are starting to grow in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:11.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.01,0:19:18.18,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I-It's just sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:20.84,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.17,0:19:25.60,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.49,0:19:28.06,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I'm taking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:40.70,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That jar...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.52,0:19:43.36,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san had one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.32,0:19:47.59,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:11.44,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.44,0:20:13.92,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What? Another one's coming off?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.53,0:20:17.24,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I need a mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:22.16,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll probably continue getting flustered over small things from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.15,0:20:26.12,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's probably true for a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:30.47,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Does is hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.94,0:20:32.66,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:37.65,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.93,0:20:44.31,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you look like a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.31,0:20:45.39,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.69,0:20:47.27,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mail something to your house!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.11,0:20:49.14,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:50.17,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.55,0:20:50.17,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.83,0:20:55.78,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I think that smile will turn into my own happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:20:57.84,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.17,0:21:00.34,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:07.42,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And I think things are just fine the way they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.14,0:22:54.38,Usaghi Main I,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1,2000)}Daikichi!
